{"id":"n67327-2-4","stage":1,"title":"얼음 · 冻伤","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67327-2-4-1","ko":"너 손 너무 차갑다.","zh":"你的手也太凉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"손","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"차갑다.","meaning":"凉，冰凉","explanation":"차갑다：凉，冰凉；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"1","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"489db26a6bdebee8","term":"차갑다","zh":"凉，冰凉","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3","entryId":"71730","definition":"皮肤接触到的感觉很凉。","pronunciation":["차갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffdde2e69e89b4d797ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67327-2-4-2","ko":"손에 얼음이 들었는지 감각이 없어.","zh":"手好像冻得没知觉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손에","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손에","audio":"/audio/4f0dd1c88de503ae82f3.mp3"}},{"text":"얼음이","meaning":"冻僵、冻伤","explanation":"손에 얼음이 들다 指手受冻发僵、感觉迟钝；不是字面的“冰进到手里”。","readings":[{"term":"얼음","audio":"/audio/84ce6fedead1613f15cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67327","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼음이","audio":"/audio/1b7312ca0e7768bed0d3.mp3"}},{"text":"들었는지","meaning":"冻了（可能是）","explanation":"얼음이 들다 是手被冻得发僵的表达；-었는지 表示不确定的推测“是不是……了”。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"10","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었는지","audio":"/audio/190a64392f684f7887c8.mp3"}},{"text":"감각이","meaning":"感觉","explanation":"감각：感觉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감각","audio":"/audio/004cb195b4004269b6b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15430","senseId":"1","lemma":"감각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감각이","audio":"/audio/9d5f91aff67724c1b572.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"84ce6fedead1613f","term":"얼음","zh":"冻伤","audio":"/audio/84ce6fedead1613f15cf.mp3","entryId":"67327","definition":"身体的一部分被冻住，神经麻痹。","pronunciation":["어름"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"受冻（얼음이 들다）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"与 얼음 连用，指手被冻得发僵、失去感觉。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"004cb195b4004269","term":"감각","zh":"感觉","audio":"/audio/004cb195b4004269b6b9.mp3","entryId":"15430","definition":"通过眼睛、鼻子、耳朵、舌头和皮肤感知刺激。","pronunciation":["감ː각"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f70f60aec774e3e794f7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.753,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67327","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4064,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你的手也太凉了。","手好像冻得没知觉了。","那三个人里，智秀是谁？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的手也太凉了。","手好像冻得没知觉了。","那三个人里，智秀是谁？"],"answer":1}]}
